      <h2 class="content-split__heading">Enhancing Lives Through Philanthropic Leadership</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">Our mission is to enhance lives through philanthropic leadership by providing excellent donor services, making impactful grants to benefit the community, ensuring sustainability within the philanthropic sector, and serving as a leader, catalyst, and resource.</p>
      <p class="content-split__text">The Foundation manages community assets and coordinates community-wide giving over an 8-week period that culminates in the annual Tin Cup Challenge Fun Run, a major fundraising event for local nonprofits.</p>
