      <h2 class="content-split__heading">What Guides Us</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">Everything we do is rooted in our commitment to Teton Valley and the people who call it home. We believe in the power of community and the transformative impact of generosity.</p>
      <ul class="content-split__list">
        <li>Championing nonprofits serving Teton Valley</li>
