      <img src="/assets/images/about/areas-of-impact-chart.webp" alt="Community Foundation of Teton Valley areas of impact chart showing community investment" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="content-split__content" style="background: var(--color-plum);">
      <span class="content-split__eyebrow">Our History</span>
      <h2 class="content-split__heading">Growing Together Since 2007</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">The Community Foundation of Teton Valley was established to serve as a permanent philanthropic resource for the Teton Valley community. Since our founding, we have grown to manage over 50 funds, support 85+ nonprofits, and distribute millions in grants and scholarships.</p>
      <p class="content-split__text">As an affiliate of the Community Foundation of Jackson Hole, we bring professional fund management and grantmaking expertise to our community while maintaining a deep local focus on the needs and opportunities unique to Teton Valley.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

